# Intentionally empty.
#
# This repository holds only approved generated release bytes. Anything ignored
# here would be dropped from a release at `git add` without any visible error,
# which is exactly the failure the release gate exists to prevent. The Python
# boilerplate this file was created with ignored `lib/`, `build/`, `target/`,
# `*.log` and more — all plausible names inside a rendered deck.
